            "review_title": "Review at RESS Kitchen and Pub",
            "review_text": "FotoMike\nHanoi, Vietnam44 contributions\n0\nMy accidental discovery\nMar 2016 • Family\nAt my age, being a hipster is a bit odd. But walking into Ress Pub was a delight. Friendly staff and the welcoming manager were more than happy to chat and let me explore the multiple levels behind this hidden jewel near West Lake (Ho Tay).\n\nBeers were typical (Tiger, Heinkin, Bia Hanoi, etc.) at 15K dong for a mug. That's about 75 cents USD for a cold brew. Can't wait for the hot days of summer to sit back and enjoy.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 22, 2016",
